.page-section.p-100-cont.grey-light-bg.clearfix(id="outcomes-link")
    .container
        .row
            .col-md-12.text-center.mb-50
                h2.section-title
                    span.bold Outcomes we target
                p.section-subtitle Engineering-led engagements with measurable infrastructure results.
        .row
            .col-md-6
                .fes7-box.wow.fadeIn.mb-30
                    h3 20–40% AWS cost reduction
                    p After audit and remediation planning: rightsizing, Lambda and API Gateway tuning, caching, and cutting redundant spend—not generic “finops slides.”
            .col-md-6
                .fes7-box.wow.fadeIn.mb-30(data-wow-delay='100ms')
                    h3 2x–5x faster API paths (typical range)
                    p Latency improvements from profiling Go services, fixing N+1 and IO patterns, queues, and concurrency—validated against production-like load.
            .col-md-6
                .fes7-box.wow.fadeIn.mb-30(data-wow-delay='200ms')
                    h3 Stability under production load
                    p Fewer incidents from timeouts and overload when backpressure, limits, and failure domains are designed in—not bolted on after an outage.
            .col-md-6
                .fes7-box.wow.fadeIn.mb-30(data-wow-delay='300ms')
                    h3 Faster, safer deploy cycles
                    p Serverless and event-driven boundaries reduce operational drag so teams ship smaller changes with less risk.
